invariant: INV-35
file: tools/layout_probe.c
catches: test/lib-check-webpki-tcp-nonblocking.sh
reason: The probe reports ch_tls 8 bytes larger than ch_tls_priv, so the
  object's header states a layout the object does not have. Every caller
  that declares a ch_tls under that header then disagrees with the object
  about its size. lib-check's consumer against the API headers alone reads
  the object's build record and finds sizeof(ch_tls) differs.

--- old
    LAYOUT(CH_TLS_SIZE, sizeof(ch_tls_priv));
--- new
    LAYOUT(CH_TLS_SIZE, sizeof(ch_tls_priv) + 8);
